    AUTHORIZATION_DURATION_SECONDS_MAX * 1_000 +
      AUTHORIZATION_EXPIRY_ROUNDING_MILLISECONDS
  ```
- Account lease validation tolerates clock skew (`issuedAt > currentTimeSeconds + 60`), but token duration validation has no similar allowance.

