This bug was introduced in commit ca57549. The commit added provider OAuth callback functionality (`callback_provider_auth`) that calls `create_provider_connection` without catching `sqlite3.Error`, despite an earlier commit (483fde0, 11 days prior) having fixed this exact issue in the Google and GitHub OAuth callbacks by adding proper sqlite3.Error handling.

